[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361489946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120386#issuecomment-5361489946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120386","id":5361489946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP5HYGg","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T20:48:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T20:48:12Z","body":"I don't think the order of `get_property_list` is guaranteed, so it should likely not be relied on, but either way I will close this to merge with the discussion in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/75271.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361489946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5362948110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120386#issuecomment-5362948110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120386","id":5362948110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP6gYDg","user":{"login":"marcozee03","id":123316474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mo-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123316474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03","html_url":"https://github.com/marcozee03","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T22:42:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T22:42:16Z","body":"From my understanding of the other PR these shouldn't be considered duplicates. What made this catch my attention is essentially making an inspector at runtime. #75271 seems more concerned with how the separate components of property_list are ordered. Components meaning builtin properties, script properties, inherited class properties, etc... . The ordering of the different classes of the class hierarchy (and scripts) that make the final property list and not the ordering of the properties within.\n\n I understand why the freedom to reorder the components of the property-list freely is important. you could find reasons  to reorder the components for the needs of the inspector\n \n```\n// Property List is currently ordered somewhat like this\n[\nBuilt in properties,\nInherited script properties,               \nScript properties,                 \n]\n```    \nFor each of those components their internal ordering should be consistent between the editor and exported builds. And as far I can tell from looking around the repo. It seems like it could be an oversight. The use of push_front in exports used to be needed. (might have something to do with  C# source generator changes) but, It went unnoticed since it's an admittedly uncommon use case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5362948110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5363186127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120386#issuecomment-5363186127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120386","id":5363186127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP6u5zw","user":{"login":"marcozee03","id":123316474,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mo-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123316474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03","html_url":"https://github.com/marcozee03","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcozee03/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"creat